Chetooth
Modified version of Ruta (https://github.com/CODESURGEN/ruta) for Bajaj Chetak
scooters. Changes: Chetak mode in ScooterConnection.kt (read-only link to any
scooter without the Hero TCU services), ChetakLearn.kt, ChetakData.kt,
ChetakSetup.kt, Chetak-friendly pairing list, branding, build and CI.

